*Support all ASCII and Unicode characters.* This counts each individual Unicode scalar value, including surrogate pairs, counting invalid syntax as its own character.

*Capture invalid syntax using all uppercase:*

```java
if (!input.chars().filter(Character::isSurrogate).matched()) {
    throw new IllegalArgumentException("Unsupported characters");
